      "english": "Comrade! Join us! Otsu's fan club!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00066198",
      "source_words_sha256": "a1af442e2c573aaa4c406dfef88140ceda7e8af5b5015c6b7980dbe5bb45da66",
      "english": "Our love for Otsu is no different! So? Will you join?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000661FC",
      "source_words_sha256": "8666b532fbf8c2102d9691f81135baa725269709b91f8684e993f797d137aa6e",
      "english": "I asked what you'll DO!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0006628C",
      "source_words_sha256": "6ecdfc5a66541c56718042412119ccb315ccde102d5fd6ef7b881a7b3b171658",
      "english": "Shinpachi... Who do you think you are...?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00066338",
      "source_words_sha256": "96db8414cd359a49f85abf8067f60fb893fe54560fc4dff4da5476f4edf5d8bf",
      "english": "Saw Terakado... I mean, Lady Otsu, on Golden Street.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00066384",
      "source_words_sha256": "f466527fa891a2616994bb851171acf16e0774386d8d23f7c66eb552ed0ea9fd",
      "english": "You found Terakado... Lady Otsu, I mean... How nice.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000663F0",
      "source_words_sha256": "8c67f06a6d5ca90e2f6c72c8fda6fcc5401a8da2b34487fc2cc6ff16487a5da3",
      "english": "Yes, yes! That's better!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00066410",
      "source_words_sha256": "3cce8e34b2c3e7b59e9789a9be288c1091eec8bca9ede11ce4a009ab3a46e3ce",
      "english": "Good. Dismissed!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00066444",
