      "english": "Handsome? Besides me?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00066460",
      "source_words_sha256": "16adb0077e2fc0e66cdf3c5b1f87a21df9e3accc92414557b3c62cc915a233d7",
      "english": "Don't be stupid! Zura's NOT handsome!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00066490",
      "source_words_sha256": "cbe849f74501f24712e895a7a033cdc0baed0aa47b8a874ca23bcff9fb9f7940",
      "english": "...Tch.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000664A4",
      "source_words_sha256": "71cd2ce269831e61067e2ce5313610828426f26dc0b2613fcf9c43f514545a53",
      "english": "Still at it, Shinpachi?! Zura is NOT handsome!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000664DC",
      "source_words_sha256": "8cdcd8af64b19be2b896a003e2c2a2c91c78efaa2b1ed7019de5393a6cb01aae",
      "english": "...No. Even Zura would probably pass on that.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
