      "english": "Those long, narrow eyes... Couldn't resist...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0006667C",
      "source_words_sha256": "beb6fa1c4ed08a956a50e7ecc9891c007b78a3c30b7a65944760771a95500ab9",
      "english": "Found him? A peerless beauty, wasn't he?\fAhh... If only I were twenty years younger...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
